+# Accounts
+
+Terms for the multi-tenant banking accounts context.
+
+## Language
+
+**Frozen account**:
+An account temporarily prevented from normal use while staff investigate suspected misuse. It is distinct from a closed account and can return to open only through the unfreeze process.
+_Avoid_: blocked account, suspended account
+
+**Internal note**:
+A staff-only, immutable account record used to document operational or fraud-related activity. Customers never see internal notes.
+_Avoid_: customer note, public note
