@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Account freeze and unfreeze authorization and audit
+
+Account freezing is available to assigned support staff and tenant admins, while unfreezing is restricted to tenant admins for fraud-team sign-off. Each transition writes an internal account note (including the trimmed freeze reason) so the staff-visible note trail remains the audit record without changing the public account representation.
